@startuml 音乐网站序列图

skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam roundcorner 5
skinparam maxmessagesize 60
skinparam sequenceParticipant underline

actor 用户 as User
participant "登录组件\n(LoginPopup)" as Login
participant "二维码登录\n(useLoginQr)" as QR
participant "用户存储\n(UserStore)" as UserStore
participant "API服务" as API
participant "音乐播放器\n(AudioPlayer)" as Player
participant "音频存储\n(AudioStore)" as AudioStore

== 用户登录流程 ==

User -> Login: 点击登录按钮
activate Login

Login -> QR: 初始化二维码登录
activate QR

QR -> API: 请求二维码key
API --> QR: 返回二维码key

QR -> API: 创建二维码
API --> QR: 返回二维码图片URL

QR -> QR: 开始轮询二维码状态

User -> QR: 扫描二维码

QR -> API: 检查二维码状态
API --> QR: 返回授权成功状态

QR -> API: 获取用户信息
API --> QR: 返回用户详情

QR -> UserStore: 保存用户信息
activate UserStore
UserStore -> UserStore: 设置登录状态
QR --> Login: 通知登录成功
deactivate QR

Login --> User: 关闭登录窗口
deactivate Login

== 音乐播放流程 ==

User -> Player: 选择歌曲播放
activate Player

Player -> AudioStore: 添加歌曲到播放列表
activate AudioStore
AudioStore -> AudioStore: 更新当前播放索引
AudioStore --> Player: 返回更新后的播放列表
deactivate AudioStore

Player -> API: 获取歌曲URL
API --> Player: 返回歌曲URL

Player -> API: 获取歌词
API --> Player: 返回歌词数据

Player -> Player: 加载歌曲
Player -> Player: 开始播放

loop 播放过程
    Player -> Player: 更新播放进度
    Player -> Player: 更新当前歌词索引
    Player --> User: 显示播放进度和歌词
end

User -> Player: 调整音量/进度/播放模式
Player -> Player: 应用设置

User -> Player: 暂停/继续播放
Player -> Player: 切换播放状态

User -> Player: 切换下一首/上一首
Player -> AudioStore: 更新当前播放索引
AudioStore --> Player: 返回新的当前歌曲
Player -> Player: 加载并播放新歌曲

deactivate Player

@enduml